Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你刚才  说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What did you-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我仍然爱着你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I still love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.62,0:00:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我甚至不该来这里告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I know I probably shouldn't even be here telling you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.29,0:00:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟钱德在一起  我很喜欢他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean you're with Chandler, a guy I really like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说他是异性恋   我就相信你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and if you say he's straight, I'll believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但见到你之后  我知道我不说  会后悔一辈子的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}After seeing you the other night I knew if I didn't tell you I'd always regret it for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放弃你是我所做过最蠢的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Letting you go was the stupidest thing I ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.39,0:00:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不该到厨房来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y’know you're really not supposed to be back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我知道时机地点都不对  但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well yeah, I'm sorry. I know this is the wrong time and the wrong place but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I had to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你共度一生  我想娶你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to spend my life with you and marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你生儿育女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to have kids with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.41,0:00:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.95,0:00:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里为什么没摆椅子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't they put chairs back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这很疯狂  来不及了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know this is crazy, but am I too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:01:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  来不及了  这些话你3年前怎么不说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, you're too late. Where was all this three years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.29,0:01:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我是个白痴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well I know. I was an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想忘记你  真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I tried to forget you. I really did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去年吃完饭  我跑到非洲待了6个月想忘记你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know after  we had lunch last year, I spent six months in Africa trying to get you out of my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去非洲做什么  帮助盲童\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What were you doing in Africa? Working with blind kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.14,0:01:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你折磨我啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look,L...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  我们之间是不可能的了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, but umm, this-this is not going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也好   我会离开的   再也不会来烦你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's fine. I'll walk away. And I'll never bother you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.49,0:01:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但唯一前提是  你要告诉我  钱德也愿意给你这一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but only if you tell me Chandler's willing to give you everything I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.87,0:01:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他愿意  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, he is. Yeah, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.70,0:01:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他整天把婚姻挂在嘴边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...marriage is all he talks about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  是我在让他等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, I'm the one making him wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.42,0:01:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗   对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为政府的阴谋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because of the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第六季  第25集  求婚（下集）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S06E25  The One With The Proposal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:01:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.77,0:02:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.30,0:02:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很棒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't it incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.72,0:02:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡和钱德要结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica and Chandler are getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.93,0:02:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊  他们会很幸福的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. They'll be so happy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.39,0:02:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两个最要好的朋友坠入爱河   这种机率有多大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean two best friends falling in love. How often does that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并不太大  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not that often. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好替他们开心啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so happy for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.15,0:02:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是  好开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me too. So happy for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴  毫无嫉妒之心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so happy and not at all jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  没错   当然没有了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no! God, definitely not jealous. Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.71,0:03:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可能是98%的开心  2%的嫉妒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm probably 98 percent happy and maybe 2 percent jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2%  等于没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's 2 percent? That's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.05,0:03:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是9比1  我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm like 90-10. Yeah. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看见钱德了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, have you guys seen Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  但你知道谁来找过你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. But you know who did stop in here looking for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.90,0:03:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坦妮尔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tennme.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.07,0:03:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（约翰披萨店）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.03,0:03:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于婚姻   你昨天说的那些话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So that marriage stuff you were saying yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该不是真心话吧   当然是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't really believe that do you? Sure, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我觉得婚姻本身就很不近人情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, I think the whole concept of marriage is unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.17,0:03:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看猪嘛   我们来看一下猪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I mean look at pigs. Let's take a second here and look at pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猪不会有固定配偶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pigs don't mate for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猪的一生可以有一百个性伴侣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean a pig can have 100 sexual partners in a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:04:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那还只是普通的猪  而不是擅长运动的猪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's just an ordinary pig, not even a pig that's good at sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.39,0:04:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.77,0:04:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  你可能永远都不想结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you telling me you may never want to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.15,0:04:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,话不能说死  不过应该是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, never say never, but y'know, probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}yeah, neven
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们在干什么   现在又是什么啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then what are we even doing?  What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.91,0:04:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哇哇  干嘛对我施压\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, whoa, whoa, what is all this pressure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是某种新策略吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is this some new strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别再搞尔虞我诈那一套了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you put down your copy of The Rules, huh, man-trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我要走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放心  我自有打算\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay. I got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到真爱的   一定会的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're gonna find love. Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.77,0:04:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对这一点有信心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm pretty confident about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我可以有八成   替摩妮卡和钱德高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's what makes it so easy to be 80 percent happy for Monica and Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过要是有保障就好了  什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It would be nice to have a little guarantee though. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:04:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些人会跟朋友约定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, some people make deals with a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是两个人到了40都还单身   他们就结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like if neither of them are married by the time they're 40, they marry each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是指备胎   没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mean a backup? Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.83,0:05:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经找好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah. I've got that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You do? Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.84,0:05:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁   乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who? Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.34,0:05:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  真的  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey? Are you serious? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  我好几年前就锁定他了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I locked him in years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以要是你们40岁都还单身   你就嫁给乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait. So if neither of you are married by by the time you're 40, you'll marry Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们握手为定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yep. We shook on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过相信我  他可不一定这么想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. But believe me, that is not how he wanted to seal the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  他说的是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohh, yeah. I think his exact words were...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.66,0:05:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真迷人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只是个备胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, he's just a backup. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有见到瑞秋  或是镜子吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you seen Rachel? Or a mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:05:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的船长装   酷吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is for my boat. Cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很酷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.18,0:06:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  告诉船长吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa-whoa, What's the matter? Talk to the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现这段感情又是死路一条\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just having one of those days where you realize you're in a dead-end relationship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德欺负你是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler's giving you a hard time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.23,0:06:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又不是明天就要结婚   我只是想知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It’s not like I want to get married tomorrow. It's just that I-I'd like to believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是在原地打转   浪费我的时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that I'm in a relationship that's actually going somewhere, that I'm not just wasting my time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.07,0:06:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也了解钱德  不  我已经不了解钱德了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know Chandler. No, I don't know Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.41,0:06:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全不了解了  就像发生了什么事情了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not anymore. It's like something's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是你变了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才没变\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许问题就在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe that's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   钱德是很复杂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Chandler is a complex fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不太可能娶个妻子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One who is unlikely to take a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在想什么  他以为我会空等下去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What does he think? Does he think I'll just gonna wait around for nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.39,0:06:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面对现实吧   钱德反对婚姻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica face it. Chandler is against marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是不会变了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And always will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些人可是真心想娶我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, there's some people who do want to marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有吗   谁啊   理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There are? Yeah. Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:06:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查说他想娶你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Richard said he wants to marry you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而钱德说他讨厌婚姻   没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Chandler says he hates marriage? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德热爱婚姻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler loves marriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说他讨厌婚姻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You just told me he hates marriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很复杂  不太可能娶妻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That he's a complex fellow who's unlikely to take a wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.63,0:07:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他反对婚姻   一直都没变\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That he's against marriage and always will be!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.63,0:07:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这样理解我的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got that from what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  嘿  帅哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach. Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.35,0:07:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  请进  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, come on in. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟伊丽莎白分手了  真可惜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey y'know, I'm so sorry to hear about you and Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.32,0:07:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  我以为我们会白头偕老\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, thanks. Yeah, I really thought we'd be able to make it work. but uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.57,0:07:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果却是有缘无份\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess it just wasn't meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.91,0:07:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  爱情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱情真是微妙   对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a tricky business, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们要不要来做个约定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what do you say we make a pact?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.71,0:07:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们到了40还都单身   我们就结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you and I are both single by the time we're 40, we get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:08:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们双方熟知   而且喜欢对方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, we know each other, we like each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还上过床   彼此不会感到陌生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we've already slept together, so y'know there'll be no surprises there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.97,0:08:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我意思  不会觉得  "大惊小怪"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what I mean? No, like, "What's that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懂了  你是想找我当备胎   没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you want me to be your backup. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我已经有一个了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. I already have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  谁啊  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Who? Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.61,0:08:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是她说乔伊是她的备胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a—but-but she just, she said that Joey is her backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.74,0:08:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  才不是呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.78,0:08:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯   我刚跟她聊过   她说她和乔伊约好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross! I just had a conversation with her. and she said that she and Joey made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的   我们几年前早就约好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's impossible. I mean we have had a deal for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还握手为定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We shook on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过她觉得握手还不够\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Although, believe me, she wanted to do a lot more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.51,0:08:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跑到哪儿去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在跟教授做椰子电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was making a coconut phone with the Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查跟摩妮卡说  他想娶她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Richard told Monica he wants to marry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  就是啊  我一直在找你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Yeah! Yeah, I've been trying to find  you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫你别再跟她玩了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to tell to stop messing with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是这双船鞋跑一跑就掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And maybe I would have if these damn boat shoes wouldn't keep flying off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.15,0:09:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊   就是啊   这双鞋好恶心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! I know! They suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不该向我的女朋友求婚   该求婚的人是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's not supposed to ask my girlfriend to marry him! I am supposed to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  那\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know! What--?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看我怎么教训他  我要去找他  狠狠揍他一顿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what I'll do? I'll go over there and kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会帮我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.71,0:09:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  我们海扁他一顿也不是解决办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Chandler I don’t think us getting our asses kicked is not a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.55,0:09:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快去找摩妮卡吧   你说的对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, just go and find Monica. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去拿戒指  去拿戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. I'm gonna get the ring. I'm gonna get the ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要找到她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm gonna go find her ...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.89,0:09:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直接向她求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I'm just going to propose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  老兄  老兄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude! Dude! Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的椰子电话  也许很适合摆在船上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me know about that coconut phone might be good for the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.29,0:09:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.08,0:10:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.21,0:10:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我来干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.59,0:10:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又没问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.63,0:10:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要进来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.30,0:10:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我把门开着  然后坐到沙发上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'll just leave the door open and go sit on the couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德真是个笨蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler is such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喝点什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威士忌加冰块和莱姆片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'll have a scotch ... on the-Rocks with a twist?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还在抽雪茄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You still smoking cigars? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  没有  那只是"烟雾的艺术"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. That's art.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不喜欢   我可以把"艺术"灭掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If it bothers you, I can put my art out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.30,0:10:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, Monica...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我问你一个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...let me ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.14,0:10:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们分手后  你有没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, since we broke up, do you ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想过我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...think about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几个月前还想到过你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, I thought about you a couple months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.77,0:11:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗   不过是因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yeah, but it's because I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去做眼科检查   而我又不喜欢我的新医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...had an eye exam, and I don't like my new eye doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁   爱德华奈夫斯基\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who is it? Edward Nevsky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  他是不怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, he's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.20,0:11:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不检查眼科的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you ever think about me in...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.20,0:11:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有想过我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...a non-eye-doctor way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忘记你是我这一生最难的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because getting over you was the hardest thing I've ever had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我努力  不让自己想到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I never let myself think about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.27,0:11:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   你霸占了乔伊和罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, you picked Joey and Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能有两个备胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't have two backups!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.69,0:11:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.57,0:11:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼光独到才会替备胎找备胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just good sense to back up your backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经失去了钱德   什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I've already lost Chandler. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂   菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩都是你的备胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're both your backups?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.99,0:11:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你怎么可以这样对我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, How could you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.33,0:12:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你们在抱怨什么  你们都很清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't—Look I don't know what are you complaining about now? You were both aware of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们不清楚   我也不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was not! No, we weren't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来婚后我们还要这样不停地顶嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, this kind of back talk isn't gonna fly when we're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你不能两个都要  只能挑一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe! You can't have both of them! You have to pick one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.72,0:12:15.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,选我   不   选我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pick me! No, pick me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想当老处女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want to end up an old maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.31,0:12:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.85,0:12:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯是个好爸爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross is a good father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.31,0:12:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊有条游艇   好难选啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Joey has a boat. This is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太过分了   我要改换瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is crazy. Hey look, I want to switch to Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也改换瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, I wanna switch to Rachel too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   等一下   等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, wait! Okay, just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等下  伙计们  别急着做决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, guys. Wait you guys! Don't make any rash decisions.okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得我的承诺吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just remember my promise:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.74,0:12:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结婚之后  1星期3次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If we get married, three times a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Phoebe...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.79,0:12:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说按摩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm talking about massages.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.42,0:12:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不是说按摩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道该怎么解决了  这样就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, y'know what? I know how to settle this. All right here, Here's what we'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在一张纸巾上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna write "Joey"...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.09,0:12:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,写 "乔伊"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...on one napkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一张纸巾上写 "罗斯"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm going to write "Ross" on the other napkin...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.77,0:13:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们一人选一张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and we are going to pick one! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓到谁  谁就是我们的备胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that person will be our backup.Okay? Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.27,0:13:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很公平   那好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That sounds fair. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我先弄乱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. Switching them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.15,0:13:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挑一张  左边的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pick one. Left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.86,0:13:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.24,0:13:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross. Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们交换好了   没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We should just switch. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想念这套公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I miss this apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.59,0:13:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是成年人住的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, this is a grownup's apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟大人在一起  你明白吗   明白\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I should be with a grownup, do you know what I mean?! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.97,0:13:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  你要跟更成熟的人在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're saying you need to be with someone more mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.68,0:13:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe someone with...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有医师执照的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...a license to practice medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.31,0:13:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是留胡子的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or a mustache.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.44,0:13:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  我不是小孩子了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's face it. I'm not a kid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:13:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要和一个目标相同的人走到一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I need to be with someone who-who wants the same things that I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来我上班的地方向我示爱   就是我要的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean coming to my work and telling me you love me, I want that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭时闲扯猪的性爱   那样的我不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Talking about pig sex over lunch, I don't want that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为很公平\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think that's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公平  别跟我提公平\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fair? Please. Don't even talk to me about fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.67,0:14:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公平的意思是  当年你想娶我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fair would've been you wanting to marry me then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是钱德现在想娶我  都没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or Chandler wanting to marry me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.43,0:14:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  整件事一点也不公平  一点也不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Believe me, nothing about this is fair. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不公平   不公平   别激动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing! Nothing! It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.31,0:14:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不公平\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得先把事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have to figure...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.96,0:14:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想清楚  然后才能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...some stuff, before I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.75,0:14:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只管慢慢想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take as much time as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.51,0:15:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,10分钟  20分钟都行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ten, 2O minutes, if you need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.22,0:15:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会在这里  不抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be here. Not smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   她人呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler. Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不怕你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不在  请进\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's not here. And please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.25,0:15:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威士忌加冰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Scotch on the rocks...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和莱姆片  放在杯垫上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with a twist, on a coaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica? Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   她来过了  又走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, she was here. But she left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.51,0:15:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去哪里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说  她要去想清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She said she had to think things over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.01,0:15:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  我真不敢相信  我还以为你是个好人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. I can't believe this. I thought you were a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.52,0:15:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们又没怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey. Look, nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没怎么样  没怎么样  你没跟我女朋友示爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing happened? Nothing? So you didn't tell my girlfriend that you love her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:15:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, all right, one thing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你在做什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know I can't believe this! Do you know what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.61,0:16:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞得我女朋友在这东想西想的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My girlfriend is out there thinking things over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然让我的女朋友想这些事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You made my girlfriend think!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她有什么好想的   我爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what does she have to think about? I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.25,0:16:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显然  她想要的我能给她  你却不能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, apparently I'm willing to offer her things that you are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我也愿意给她那些   我只是计划着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm willing to offer her those things. This was just a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先故意让她失望   然后让她喜出望外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}y'know? A way to throw her off so when I offered all these things, she'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的确很意外  这效果确实很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well if it helps, it worked very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本来一切进展顺利   你却半路杀出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was working till you showed up, you big tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不公平\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有过机会  结果却搞砸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You had your chance with her, You had your chance and you blew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在轮到我了  我不会放过的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And this is my chance and I won't blow it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们是天生的一对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because we are meant for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不过犯了个愚蠢的错误而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And this has all just been one stupid mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来打算今晚求婚的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was gonna propose tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:16:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were gonna propose?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我还\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I even...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.92,0:17:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备了戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...got a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你准备了戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you get a ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.72,0:17:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我没准备\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I don't have a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能得到她的  钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You go get her Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过  我能给你一个忠告吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And can I give you a piece of advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你能得到她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you do get her...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.36,0:17:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定要好好珍惜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...don't let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.28,0:17:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查  你的确是个好人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, Richard, you are a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我恨这点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.51,0:17:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  待会儿再说  我得去找摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude. I can't talk to you now,  I've gotta find Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.47,0:17:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.97,0:17:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  她走了  提着个包包走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? She’s gone. She had a bag and she left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.56,0:18:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么  她哭得很伤心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about? She was all crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.77,0:18:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说你们追求的目标不一样   她需要时间思考\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She said you guys want different things and she needs time to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不栏住她   告诉她这只是个计划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well why didn't you stop her?  Why didn't you tell her it was a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了  我都说了  钱德   但是她不信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did! I told her everything. Chandler! She wouldn't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那她  去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, where--?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她去哪儿了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她父母家吧   我想  她叫你不要打电话找她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To her parents' I think and she said you shouldn't call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我就会打\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But if I were you, I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.12,0:18:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事我居然搞砸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't believe I ruined this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾  伙计\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am so sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.56,0:18:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你希望给她个惊喜的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanted it to be a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.03,0:18:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.87,0:19:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in all my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.58,0:19:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从来没想过我会这么幸运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I never thought I would be so lucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以爱上我最要好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...as to fall in love with my best...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最要好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My best...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以女孩子从不主动求婚嘛  好吧  好吧  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a reason why girls don't do this! Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来  我曾以为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll do it. I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.27,0:19:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   我来求婚吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为  开口求婚的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought that it mattered...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时间地点很重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...what I said or where I said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来我才发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then I realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一重要的就是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the only thing that matters is that you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.59,0:19:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让我得到超乎想像的幸福\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You make me happier than I ever thought I could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.05,0:19:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以如果你愿意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if you let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意付出余生   让你跟我一样幸福\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I will spend the rest of my life trying to make you feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.45,0:20:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意嫁给我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.55,0:20:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你会娶妻的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I knew you were likely to take a wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.85,0:20:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以进去了吗   我们等得快急死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can we come in yet? We're dying out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.52,0:20:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进来吧   进来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come in! Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.19,0:20:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们订婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're engaged!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.74,0:20:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我最不嫉妒的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is the least jealous I've ever been!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.41,0:21:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  不行  罗斯不在场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, wait! This is wrong! Ross isn't here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Oh.
